OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, mostly light and patchy, but
OL,7,Fsome of which may be on the heavier
OL,8,Fside in the afternoon. Fresh to strong
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy day with outbreaks
OL,12,Fof rain, mostly light and patchy, but
OL,13,Fsome of which may be on the heavier
OL,14,Fside in the afternoon. Fresh to strong
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FGood spells of sunshine in the
OL,18,Fmorning with just the odd passing
OL,19,Fshower. Remaining bright during the
OL,20,Fafternoon but turning generally
OL,21,Fcloudier with a few scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
